{"resourceIdentifier":"2568","resourceName":"Hainan Lingshui Mangrove Blue Carbon Project","description":"Hainan Lingshui Mangrove Blue Carbon Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is about mangrove afforestation on degraded mangrove habitat. It will achieve net GHG emissions or removals by carbon sequestration. The project locates in Lingshui County, Hainan Province with the area of 192.17ha (2882.6 mu).\r\n \r\nThe goals of the project are to increase the mangrove area and the forest coverage rate so as to protect, sustain and recover the integrity, stability and consecutiveness of local wetland ecosystem. \r\n\r\nThe estimated annual emission reduction of the project is 2,527 tCO2-e, and the total estimated emission reductions will reach 75,796  tCO2-e. According to the Non-Permanence Risk Report, with buffering deducting, the estimated annual emission reduction of the project is 2,274 tCO2-e, and the total estimated emission reductions will reach 68,216  tCO2-e.","location":{"latitude":18.430089,"longitude":110.016442},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-12-23","endExclusive":"2022-01-23","endInclusive":"2022-01-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2568"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hainan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Lingshui County Forestry Bureau"},{"type":"string","value":"Hainan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86-186 8997 1252"},{"type":"string","value":"CN21002100@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2527"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"cod